# NestedModules (.NET)

Native bindings for nested_modules

The `NestedModules` namespace binds the `nested_modules` native library through
source-generated P/Invoke (`[LibraryImport]`), so it's trim- and
AOT-friendly.

## Build

```bash
dotnet build
```

Reference this project from yours (`dotnet add reference NestedModules.csproj`)
or pack it (`dotnet pack -c Release`).

## Loading the native library

The bindings load `nested_modules` with the platform's normal rules
(`libnested_modules.dylib`, `libnested_modules.so`, or `nested_modules.dll` next to the app or on the
library search path). Set `NESTED_MODULES_LIBRARY` to a full path to load a
specific file instead.

